  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of public secondary school graduation rate through establishing  School-Community Education-Welfare Network  in Battambang, Cambodia(2nd Phase)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance educational accessibility for students in public schools in Cambodia through school-community governance, we aim to first establish a public-private education welfare network based on school-community cooperation. Second, we seek to strengthen the support system for students through the established public-private education welfare network.&#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xCC38;&#xC5EC; &#xD611;&#xB825;&#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xD559;&#xC0DD;&#xB4E4;&#xC758; &#xD559;&#xC5C5;&#xC720;&#xC9C0;&#xB97C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xD558;&#xACE0;&#xC790; &#xD568;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the academic retention of students in the partner schools, the following outputs are planned improving the educational environment of schools, strengthening economic and psychological academic support for at-risk students, and strengthening community participation to create a supportive academic environment.</narrative>
  </description>
